<title>POLAND: ZEW MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZEW MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.30 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.71 vs   0.63</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.90 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Sales		   14.67 vs  12.45</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.39 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.40 vs   3.57</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.24 vs   6.11</p>
<p> Sales		   68.79 vs  62.29</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electrod maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Elektrod Weglowych SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
